    {
      "subId": "30601",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3061101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3061101": {
            "id": "3061101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "This is it. One of the deserted <color=#00E1FFFF>temples of The Four Winds</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061102"
            ]
          },
          "3061102": {
            "id": "3061102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "These temples have been left to waste for years now. The people of Mondstadt almost never come here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061103"
            ]
          },
          "3061103": {
            "id": "3061103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "There's a chance there's a monster nest or a hilichurl camp inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061104"
            ]
          },
          "3061104": {
            "id": "3061104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Even Stormterror has given up on its own temple.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061107"
            ]
          },
          "3061107": {
            "id": "3061107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "...Yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061108"
            ]
          },
          "3061108": {
            "id": "3061108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I also find it hard to accept, but... Stormterror was once one of The Four Winds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061109"
            ]
          },
          "3061109": {
            "id": "3061109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ehhhh!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061110"
            ]
          },
          "3061110": {
            "id": "3061110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Wait... Did you just feel that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061111"
            ]
          },
          "3061111": {
            "id": "3061111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "The wind here... Something's off...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061112"
            ]
          },
          "3061112": {
            "id": "3061112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "#Let's go in and take a look, {NICKNAME}. Be careful, the dragon's power is disturbing this area."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "30602",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the temple",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "30612",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3061201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3061201": {
            "id": "3061201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Everyone in Mondstadt is still getting blown about by the storm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061202"
            ]
          },
          "3061202": {
            "id": "3061202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Every second we waste is a mark against the name of Favonius. Let's get in that temple, stat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "30603",
      "subQuestName": "Explore the temple's depths",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "30610",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3061001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3061001": {
            "id": "3061001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Phew, I'm tired.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061002"
            ]
          },
          "3061002": {
            "id": "3061002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "But, at least this way we've helped Jean out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061003"
            ]
          },
          "3061003": {
            "id": "3061003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "In the past, we were at least able to defend the city and keep it safe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061004"
            ]
          },
          "3061004": {
            "id": "3061004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "This, of course, is mostly thanks to Jean.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061005"
            ]
          },
          "3061005": {
            "id": "3061005",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "But now with Stormterror directly attacking the city itself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061006"
            ]
          },
          "3061006": {
            "id": "3061006",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "\"The winds change, so too should our tactics.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061009"
            ]
          },
          "3061009": {
            "id": "3061009",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "It's what Lisa likes to say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061010"
            ]
          },
          "3061010": {
            "id": "3061010",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Speaking of which, The Four Winds we were discussing earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061011"
            ]
          },
          "3061011": {
            "id": "3061011",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "If you want to learn more about our history, you can ask Lisa.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061012"
            ]
          },
          "3061012": {
            "id": "3061012",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "...I'm not saying I don't know our history! It's just...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3061013"
            ]
          },
          "3061013": {
            "id": "3061013",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I mean... A librarian is supposed to be more knowledgeable than an Outrider, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
